Name[fr]=amadeOS Numérisation
Name[es]=amadeOS Escanear imagen
Name[it]=amadeOS Scansione immagini
GenericName=Scanner
GenericName[de]=Scanner
GenericName[fr]=Numériseur
GenericName[es]=Escáner
GenericName[it]=Scanner
Comment=Scan images and documents from a flatbed scanner
